76
00:06:11.144 --> 00:06:22.563
(narrator) Then the tangle disappears: a gold PaymentGateway interface badge with charge and refund sits between the services and the provider, and the services' couriers now carry their envelopes, along arrows, to the badge.

77
00:06:22.563 --> 00:06:29.394
(narrator) A suave secret agent in a dinner jacket and bow tie, martini in hand, appears in a spotlight and says: Gateway, Payment Gateway.

78
00:06:29.394 --> 00:06:32.009
(narrator) Agent Payment Gateway's secret is which provider.

79
00:06:32.009 --> 00:06:41.774
(narrator) Only a PayPalGateway file below it holds the PayPal secret; a dashed line ending in a hollow triangle shows that it implements the interface, and an arrow carries its calls to PayPal.

80
00:06:41.774 --> 00:06:47.644
(narrator) A StripeGateway plugs in beside it with its own dashed implements line, and all three services stay unchanged.

81
