118
00:09:08.491 --> 00:09:11.235
(narrator) On can't tell, the charger gets a spy's blindfold.

119
00:09:11.235 --> 00:09:15.737
(narrator) The solar farm changes to wind turbines at midnight, and the phone keeps charging.

120
00:09:15.737 --> 00:09:20.787
(narrator) The outlet gets the gold Interface badge; the power plant gets a sealed top secret envelope.

121
00:09:21.393 --> 00:09:24.293
♪ Picture an iceberg. The tip’s the interface: ♪

122
00:09:24.293 --> 00:09:27.153
