147
00:11:02.433 --> 00:11:07.997
(narrator) The debrief: a clipboard checklist, list the likely changes, pick one, count the modules it touches.

148
00:11:07.997 --> 00:11:12.114
(narrator) Two dependency graphs compare the same callers for a new payment provider.

149
00:11:12.114 --> 00:11:14.561
(narrator) Arrows point to what each module depends on.

150
00:11:14.561 --> 00:11:21.571
(narrator) In the hidden design, five callers depend on Gateway, and only Gateway depends on the external provider: only Gateway changes.

151
00:11:21.571 --> 00:11:27.747
(narrator) In the leaky design, there is no Gateway: all five callers depend on the provider directly, so all five change.

152
00:11:27.747 --> 00:11:31.307
